# Per-cell workspaces and transcripts are large and reproducible — tarballed on
# demand, never committed. The evidence (manifest, matrix.jsonl, results.jsonl,
# analysis/) IS committed, per the plan's reproducibility rules.
runs/*/cells/
# SWE-bench's own per-cell dir name (full repo checkouts per cell)
runs/*/workspaces/
runs/*/**/transcript*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
datasets/*
# ...except the pin registry itself -- small, and the one source of truth an
# experiment manifest's [tasks].dataset name resolves against. (`datasets/*`,
# not `datasets/`, so git actually recurses in to check this negation --
# excluding the directory itself would make the exception unreachable.)
!datasets/registry.toml
